{
"Items.FlintlockPistol.Desc": "A firearm using a flint striking ignition mechanism. As the flint is struck, the black powder inside is detonated and propels the loaded lead ball forward at breakneck speed, putting anything in its path in harm's way. Speed has a factor in how much damage is dealt."
"Items.FlintlockPistol.Long": "a flintlock pistol"
"Items.FlintlockPistol.Short": "Flintlock Pistol"
}
